      <div style="margin-top:34px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)">
        <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px">How this guide was put together</h4>
        <p style="color:var(--muted-2);font-size:.95rem;margin:0">ePegboard does not sell shuttlecocks and has no affiliate arrangement with a shuttle manufacturer. This guide draws on the BWF Laws of Badminton, BWF's announcements on synthetic shuttle development, published academic research on shuttle flight and durability, current English league rules, manufacturer specifications and UK retailer prices checked on 26 August 2026. We found no credible published breakage or retirement rate for ordinary club-level play; where the article recommends measuring your own club, that absence is the reason rather than an omission.</p>
